lg:SK-EOB-s4-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "c55339146d0127bbec8e0de8801aab51bd303d317c8cea61c0e06b903c798846" ;
    lgo:text """(1) A service provider is obliged to give the recipient of the service on an electronic device in particular the following information:
a) the name, business name and seat of the service provider, if it is a legal person, or the name, surname, place of business and residential address of the service provider, if it is a natural person,
b) the tax identification number, if it is a value added tax payer,
c) the e-mail address and telephone number,
d) the designation of the register in which it is entered and the entry number,
e) the name and address of the supervisory or oversight body to which the service provider's activity is subject."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-EOB-s4-1-q1 .

lg:SK-EOB-s4-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "04ad229b7b46ff7a906a0178c55e67dcfa07cae7471e5e9765bee5afc0eb41f4" ;
    lgo:text "(2) In the commercial communication of persons under § 3(7), the service provider must additionally give the recipient of the service on an electronic device, besides the data under paragraph 1, the name and seat of the competent self-governing professional organisation established by a special regulation in which the person exercising a regulated profession is entered, its academic title and the member state in which the academic title was obtained, a reference to the relevant rules for exercising the profession and providing services laid down by the self-governing professional organisation, and the manner of permanent access to information about that professional organisation."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-EOB-s4-2-q1 .

lg:SK-EOB-s4-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7f9d28bd9b39fa0cd005619dab284eac9489555d49039805ff9c857c4ecc2fbd" ;
    lgo:text "(3) The information under paragraphs 1 and 2 must be easily and permanently accessible to the recipient of the service and distinguishable from commercial communication."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-EOB-s4-3-q1 .

lg:SK-EOB-title-5b1569ed5853-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5b1569ed585386a7cafc115d5f8fa05909bcb866477f44591f692276d6c40617" ;
    lgo:text "Act no. 22/2004 Coll. on electronic commerce and on amendments to Act no. 128/2002 Coll. on state control of the internal market in matters of consumer protection and on amendments to certain acts, as amended by Act no. 284/2002 Coll."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-12"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-EOB .

lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1e3ff36882a9a69e9637b7f1e7f41b135ab4dc9934a4396b5cfaf461aba4e915" ;
    lgo:text "(1) In the interest of consumer protection, the use of the state language is compulsory when labelling the content of domestic and imported goods, in instructions for use of products, in particular foodstuffs, medicines, consumer electronics and drugstore goods, in warranty conditions and in other consumer information to the extent and under the conditions laid down by special regulations."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-1-q1 .

lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-5-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2c6c6fdb2ea4c1b86f85de6cbae53d5e97a5b01deab531a7c626ff3494c59ff1" ;
    lgo:text "(5) In proceedings before the authorities and legal persons under § 3(1), contracts governing obligatory relations are recognised, alongside the state-language version, also in another official language of the European Union. In the event of ambiguities or inconsistencies, the state-language version of the contract shall prevail."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-5-q1 .

lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-6-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "671610bfb1498664c25c6c6d4791dbe4825539474365ffd7ee4cf93b87736a29" ;
    lgo:text "(6) All signs, advertisements and notices intended to inform the public, in particular in shops, on sports grounds, in restaurants, on streets, at and above roads, at airports, bus stations and railway stations, and in public transport vehicles shall be displayed in the state language. If they contain text in other languages, the foreign-language texts shall follow the state-language text and must be identical in content to the state-language text. The foreign-language text shall be displayed in equal or smaller type than the state-language text. In signs and notices intended to inform the public in the language of a national minority and in the state language in municipalities where the language of that national minority is used in official communication under a special regulation, and in advertising, the order of the texts is not prescribed."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-6-q1 .

lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-7-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1e29e5eca60c4914160a54cc5990459df40505874bd395df2c383bd3539513a9" ;
    lgo:text "(7) The obligation laid down in paragraph 6 shall not apply to the trade name, trade mark, or name of an institution entered or included in registers or lists under the laws in force in the Slovak Republic or in another Member State of the European Union or in a contracting state of the Agreement on the European Economic Area, nor to the use of first names and surnames forming part of a sign, advertisement or notice intended to inform the public, nor to certain customary expressions in a foreign language which are commonly used together with the trade mark in the text of advertisements, are known to the widest public and form part of the advertisement."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-JAZYK-270-s8-7-q1 .

lg:SK-JAZYK-270-title-9e60190f0bad-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "9e60190f0bad8bed586bcbec216cdd5bd3b4548bc7601f61ef91f7f92204a728" ;
    lgo:text "Act of the National Council of the Slovak Republic No. 270/1995 Coll. on the State Language of the Slovak Republic"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "swe-2-high" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-JAZYK-270 .

lg:SK-OBCH-s3a-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a4c880221a549eef2c97dff4b346a825f4d87df8aa515da897cf0248a14162a3" ;
    lgo:text "Every entrepreneur is obliged to state the following on his or her business letters and orders made in written or electronic form (hereinafter “business documents”): the business name, the seat or place of business, the legal form of a legal person and the identification number, if assigned. Entrepreneurs entered in the commercial register or in another register of entrepreneurs also state the designation of the register in which the entrepreneur is entered and the entry number. If an entrepreneur states the amount of the share capital on his or her business documents, he or she must also state the extent to which it has been paid up."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-OBCH-s3a-1-q1 .

lg:SK-OBCH-s3a-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "23dece703b6e13f08ecf0109ee5eb3446e76468941228b2000de49a095ebeeaf" ;
    lgo:text "The data under paragraph 1 must also be stated by the entrepreneur in written official correspondence."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-OBCH-s3a-2-q1 .

lg:SK-OBCH-s3a-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "2f660ec934988bd1b4dae1c5e36113f162616c818bef0541731e0a7e993c89c4" ;
    lgo:text "The data under paragraph 1 must also be stated by the entrepreneur on his or her website, if he or she has one."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-OBCH-s3a-3-q1 .

lg:SK-OBCH-title-514e7f397171-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "514e7f397171027eb5e949cbc4ddc5fd0d42d2897c19f88f77950d08f7ff71a4" ;
    lgo:text "Commercial Code (Obchodný zákonník)"@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translatedProperty eli:title ;
