lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "e0538ed5425c0d4395e08fb3c1336b762a0d990f314e4de929d328895412ac7a" ;
    lgo:text """(1) The publisher of a periodical publication is obliged to ensure that every issue of periodical print media contains
a) the title of the periodical publication,
b) the title of the regional or language version of the periodical publication and an indication that it is a regional or language edition of the periodical publication, if the periodical publication is issued or made available to the public in a modified form in terms of territorial scope or language of publication,
c) the frequency of publication,
d) information about the publisher of the periodical publication, namely
1. the name, seat and identification number of the organisation, if the publisher of the periodical publication is a legal person,
2. the business name, place of business and identification number of the organisation, if the publisher of the periodical publication is a natural person – entrepreneur,
3. the first name, surname and address of permanent residence in the territory of the Slovak Republic, if the publisher of the periodical publication is a natural person,
e) the date of issue, serial number in the calendar year and volume year of the periodical publication,
f) the price of the printed copy or other copy of the periodical publication,
g) the international standard serial number (ISSN), if assigned,
h) the registration number of the periodical publication; this does not apply during proceedings for entry in the register under § 3."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-1-q1 .

lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "b33deb7725778c50e58b8f0bd4bab7b6d1794a2c5445f34528f724c6201cc568" ;
    lgo:text "(2) The publisher of a periodical publication is obliged to ensure that every issue of an electronic periodical publication contains the information under paragraph 1 or that this information is given in accompanying text connected with the electronic periodical publication and easily accessible to the public."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-2-q1 .

lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "1324bfebaa09de84ac49510d2717a0d92c3135a58d20301b71209ec3d08a47b9" ;
    lgo:text "(3) The operator of a news web portal is obliged to ensure that the news web portal is marked with the title, the date of publication of the communiqué, the date of update of the published communiqué, and that it contains information about the operator of the news web portal to the extent under paragraph 1(d) and the information under paragraph 1(h)."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-3-q1 .

lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-4-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "b847828ded4c2e888089263b1aaaf2785befa119e0bf1b76f16f98581d0e556f" ;
    lgo:text "(4) A press agency is obliged to ensure that the agency service is marked with the name of the press agency and the date of publication."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "Devin (SWE-2)" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-13"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:SK-PUB-265-s5-4-q1 .

